# P7 implementation standards

**Rule:** P7 **delivers** the P6 product on staging — same modular boundaries, same three apps, same workspace plugin model. No new architectural layer.

**Execution:** Read [P7-EXECUTION-DISCIPLINE.md](p7/appendices/P7-EXECUTION-DISCIPLINE.md) — walkthrough on staging before any product code; progress = staging proof only.

**Authority stack:** P6 implementation standards → P7 boundaries → EPIC nano.

---

## 1. Layer cake (unchanged from P6)

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ apps/{web|portal|marketing}  — routes + BFF only        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ packages/workspaces/denali — plugin rules, HTTP, UI     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ apps/api — tenant, canonical, workspace-finance         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ packages/workspace-sdk · tenant-kernel                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

P7 adds **deployment profiles** and **staging proof** — not new layers.

---

## 2. Staging profiles (P7-0)

| Profile | Use | Session / OTP |
| ------- | --- | ------------- |
| **A** Local dev | Engineer iteration | `ALLOW_DEV_WEB_SESSION` · static OTP ok |
| **B** VPS IP | First staging | HTTP · coherence scripts |
| **C** Subdomain | Production-like | TLS · real SMS · dev flags **off** |

Authority: [runbooks/p7-0-env-matrix.md](p7/runbooks/p7-0-env-matrix.md)

---

## 3. Modular change rules by EPIC

| EPIC | Touch surfaces | Pattern |
| ---- | -------------- | ------- |
| P7-0 | `deploy/vps/` · env · seed scripts | infra-only PRs |
| P7-1 | `apps/web/app/tours/new/` · settings seed | Z2 complete — minimal diff |
| P7-2 | `apps/web/app/(app)/tours/[id]/workspace/` | Z3 additive |
| P7-3 | E2E configs · gate scripts | verification-only |

---

## 4. Finance (payment vs ledger)

| Layer | P7 change |
| ----- | --------- |
| Payment ingress | staging MinIO/fileKey path verified |
| Ledger spine | **no schema change** — T3 `finance-ops.spec.ts` |

See [appendices/PAYMENT-LEDGER-BOUNDARY.md](p7/appendices/PAYMENT-LEDGER-BOUNDARY.md).

---

## 5. Doc-first (P7)

Before code in `apps/api` · `apps/web` · `apps/marketing` · `apps/portal` · `packages/workspaces/denali`:

1. Update `docs/phase-20/` EPIC or appendix
2. ONE nano per PR where possible
3. `pnpm run p7:gate`

---

## 6. Verification

| Check | Command |
| ----- | ------- |
| Regression | `pnpm run p7:gate` |
| Staging smoke | `pnpm run p7:staging-verify` |
| Wizard preservation | `denali-publish-readiness.spec.ts` |

